        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSF600, Solid Brass Extra Heavy Duty 6\" Floor Mount Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a extra tall door stop for out swinging doors with a step down. Normally used on commercial and residential exterior doors including patio doors. It includes new fasteners for wood or concrete installation and available in 9 great finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis tall door stop is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the knob or lever as well. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSF600U-specifications.gif?v=1704354570\" width=\"318\" height=\"212\" border=\"0\" alt=\"6 Inch Tall Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: With a door hold open hook <a href=\"/products/6-inch-extra-heavy-duty-floor-mount-door-stop-with-catch-deltana-dsf630\"><b>Deltana DSF630 6 Inch Door Stop with Catch</b></a>\r\nand <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tips</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DSF600 6 Inch Tall Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\"><b>Rubber Bumper</b></a>: 1\" Diameter, Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSF600.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  DSF600 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
