                "title": "6 Inch Tall Floor Mount Door Stop",
                "description": "6 Inch Tall Door Stop, Deltana DSF600 - This is a extra tall door stop for out swinging doors with a step down. Normally used on commercial and residential exterior doors including patio doors. It includes new fasteners for wood or concrete installation and available in 9 great finishes. ",
